  _speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5b0efb9ebf8804f39a64eb09f5e67af0, type: 2}
  _lines:
  - 'One: Become the new Manager.'
  - You alone will be free of Roaches, for you will join the Company. They will not
    bother you.
  - 'Be whatever kind of Manager you wish to be. You need only follow one doctrine:
    increase our Profits. I believe you will do us well.'
  - 'Two: Go home with Emily.'
  - Endure the Roaches for the rest of your putrid life.
  _options:
  - _optionText: ((my spirit is mine alone... i'm going home))
